      "texto": {
        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (60–80 words).** Write about how you learn Spanish: what you do, what is easy, what is hard and what helps you.\n\n**Speak (about 1 minute).** Tell someone about your school years: your best subject, your worst and a teacher you remember."
